{"content":[{"c":["PHILEMON (P",{"c":["erson"],"sourceClass":"lc","t":"span"},")"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Christian known only from the letter addressed to him by the apostle Paul. He is mentioned nowhere else in the NT. From ",{"href":"?bref=Col.4.17","r":"Col.4.17","rawR":"Col.4.17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Col.4.17","value":"Col.4.17"}],"t":"ref","v":"Colossians 4:17"}," it is clear that Archippus, mentioned along with Philemon in ",{"href":"?bref=Phlm.1.2","r":"Phlm.1.2","rawR":"Phlm.1.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Phlm.1.2","value":"Phlm.1.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"Philemon 1:2"}," (and perhaps his son), was a man of Colosse. Although Paul had never visited that city (",{"href":"?bref=Col.2.1","r":"Col.2.1","rawR":"Col.2.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Col.2.1","value":"Col.2.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"Col 2:1"},"), he obviously knew Philemon well. He addressed him as “our beloved co-worker” (",{"href":"?bref=Phlm.1.1","r":"Phlm.1.1","rawR":"Phlm.1.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Phlm.1.1","value":"Phlm.1.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"Phlm 1:1"},"); perhaps Philemon had been a colleague during Paul’s three-year mission in Ephesus (",{"href":"?bref=Acts.19.8-10","r":"Acts.19.8-10","rawR":"Acts.19.8-10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.19.8-10","value":"Acts.19.8-10"}],"t":"ref","v":"Acts 19:8-10"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Acts.20.31","r":"Acts.20.31","rawR":"Acts.20.31","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.20.31","value":"Acts.20.31"}],"t":"ref","v":"20:31"},"), and Paul knew that he could appeal to him on behalf of his runaway slave, Onesimus."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=PhilemonLetterto_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"PhilemonLetterto_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"PhilemonLetterto_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Philemon, Letter to"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"PhilemonPerson","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Colossians 4:17","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Col.4.17","rawQueryValue":"Col.4.17","sourceRefExact":"Col.4.17"},{"anchorText":"Philemon 1:2","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Phlm.1.2","rawQueryValue":"Phlm.1.2","sourceRefExact":"Phlm.1.2"},{"anchorText":"Col 2:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Col.2.1","rawQueryValue":"Col.2.1","sourceRefExact":"Col.2.1"},{"anchorText":"Phlm 1:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Phlm.1.1","rawQueryValue":"Phlm.1.1","sourceRefExact":"Phlm.1.1"},{"anchorText":"Acts 19:8-10","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Acts.19.8-10","rawQueryValue":"Acts.19.8-10","sourceRefExact":"Acts.19.8-10"},{"anchorText":"20:31","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Acts.20.31","rawQueryValue":"Acts.20.31","sourceRefExact":"Acts.20.31"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"4d6ec0832aa08a85b883f6d07bb5525a54ba183f1900e6d2cfdac42e05384fd1","sourceItemName":"PhilemonPerson","sourceItemOrder":163,"sourceMember":"Articles/P.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"PhilemonPerson","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Philemon (Person)","title":"Philemon (Person)","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}